# Getting Started

This guide walks you through installing, configuring, and running {{project_name}}.

## Installation

Add {{project_name}} to your project:

```console
uv add {{project_name}}
```

Or install from source:

```console
uv sync
uv lock
```

## Configuration

{{project_name}} runs with sensible defaults. If you need to customize, set environment variables with the `{{python_package_name|upper}}_` prefix:

```console
export {{python_package_name|upper}}_ENVIRONMENT=production
export {{python_package_name|upper}}_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
```

Or create a `.env` file in your project root. See the {ref}`api-reference` for all available options.

## Quick Start

Run the CLI:

```console
{{project_name}} --help
```

Or run as a module:

```console
python -m {{python_package_name}}
```

For verbose output:

```console
{{project_name}} run --verbose
```

